        },
        {
          "text": "Kuzakuthi ngalolosuku iTire likhohlakale okweminyaka engamatshumi ayisikhombisa, elingana lezinsuku zokubusa kwenkosi ibenye. Ekupheleni kweminyaka engamatshumi ayisikhombisa kuzakuba khona eTire okutshiwo yingoma yewule ukuthi:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
