              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuzakuthi ekupheleni kweminyaka engamatshumi ayisikhombisa iNkosi ilikhumbule iTire; lizabuyela ekuwuleni kwalo; lizakuwula layo yonke imibuso yomhlaba. ",
          "type": "text",
